Placeholder so this directory exists in version control / your deploy
zip. config/config.php creates it automatically at runtime if missing
and PHP can write here, but committing an empty dir ahead of time avoids
relying on that on hosts where the storage/ parent itself is writable
but mkdir() is restricted for some reason.

Already covered by storage/.htaccess (Require all denied) one level up
— Apache applies that recursively to this subdirectory too, so session
data here is not web-accessible, same as portfolio.sqlite next to it.
